## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Sáu: Nhìn lại tuần

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

### 16:40–17:00 · Nói to có ghi âm — 3 phút

> **1. What I did**
> *"Push notifications and deep linking. Both are working across all three app states, including cold start, which is where most deep link bugs live."*
>
> **2. The bug I'm glad I found**
> *"Cold start with the user signed out. The app launches, the router tries to navigate to the link target, but the session is still loading — so the auth guard redirects to sign-in and the link is silently dropped. It works perfectly if you test with the app already open. I hold the target now and navigate after the session resolves."*
>
> **3. Something I should have done earlier**
> *"I put the app in front of five real people for the first time. ___ . Fifty days of building and it took an afternoon of watching someone else use it to see that."*
>
> **4. Next week**
> *"Reanimated and gestures — the last technical gap on my list. Then the final week is entirely mock interviews."*

**Kiêm buổi họp một mình.**

